FULL_STACK_DEVELOPER_2026_COMPLETE - Phase 04                                                    Health Endpoint, Configuration and Shutdown

Build a health endpoint as the backend proof point

GET /health                  HealthController                  HealthService                  200 JSON

HTTP request                   route boundary                   returns status             observable result

A health endpoint proves the API process is alive before database or authentication complexity is added.

Figure - Health endpoint as a minimal, verifiable backend checkpoint.

apps/api/src/health/health.service.ts
import { Injectable } from '@nestjs/common';

@Injectable()
export class HealthService {
getStatus() {
return {
status: 'ok',
service: 'taskflow-api',
};
}
}

